{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57588","headline":"老君本生经颂一章 · 无名氏","name":"老君本生经颂一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆生之本际，寂然无起灭。\n弱丧迷其根，自与真源别。\n妄作善恶缘，祸福报无绝。\n欲得苦海倾，当使爱河竭。\n守一固专柔，持此无疵缺。\n正智通羣有，妙慧摧诸结。\n万行混同归，三乘泯殊辙。\n真静离尘垢，清凉无恼热。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}